  "details": "I made a palette to control my trail pen. In order to use as many colors as possible, I wanna create a HSV color palette, which is a 3D model like a cylinder, and I'll make a two axis puppet to control its cross section circle and make a radial puppet to control its height. Now the problem is that controls in VRCExpressionMenu has only two axis puppet at most(four axis puppet is also two axis essentially). I know I can control them separately, but it's not my ideal work. So I hope vrchat team can allow add more types in one control in VRCExpressionMenu.",
